# A password whose middle two letters are no level's.
#
# `$82:B018` turns it down at its first table, with thirteen pairs tried:
# level 1, carry set. The game then starts at level 1, which is what frame
# 2990 shows.
#
# Its second character is the grid's `$3C`, the fourth of the bottom row,
# which is entered as `$2F`. So this is also the only movie in which
# `cursor_pick` takes that path.
#
# Regenerate with:
#
#     python tools/make_password_movie.py "B!BB" > movies/password-no-level.zmv
#
# and put this comment back.
